<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Legacy Home &amp; Respite Care Foundation — Caregiver Wellness &amp; Resource Hub</title>
<meta name="description" content="Supporting dementia caregivers through community, wellness, and respite.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:wght@500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>


{% set active_page = 'index' %}
{% include '_header.html.j2' %}

<section class="hero has-video">
  <video class="hero-video" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata"
         poster="media/hero-poster.jpg" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">
    <source src="media/hero.webm" type="video/webm">
    <source src="media/hero.mp4" type="video/mp4">
  </video>
  <div class="hero-scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container hero-content">
    <h1>Supporting Dementia Caregivers Through Community, Wellness, and Respite.</h1>
    <p class="lede">At Legacy Home and Respite Care Foundation, we believe caregivers deserve support, too. Through respite, wellness programming, education, and meaningful community connections, we help family caregivers navigate the dementia journey without feeling alone.</p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a href="request-support.html" class="btn btn-coral">Find Support</a>
      <a href="#donate" class="btn btn-outline-light">Donate</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">You are not alone</span>
      <h2>Caring for someone living with dementia is one of life's most challenging journeys.</h2>
      <p>Whether you've recently received a diagnosis or have been caregiving for years, you don't have to navigate it alone. Legacy Home and Respite Care Foundation exists to create spaces where caregivers feel supported, connected, and empowered. We believe that when caregivers are cared for, families are stronger, communities are healthier, and individuals living with dementia experience better quality of life.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="background: var(--sand);">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">How we help</span>
      <h2>Supporting caregivers in every stage of the journey.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon">🤝</div>
        <h3>Community</h3>
        <p>Build meaningful connections with other caregivers who understand your experience.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon">💚</div>
        <h3>Wellness</h3>
        <p>Prioritize your own health through wellness programming, self-care opportunities, and caregiver-centered experiences.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon">📚</div>
        <h3>Education</h3>
        <p>Gain practical knowledge, tools, and confidence through workshops, support groups, and educational resources.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon">🏡</div>
        <h3>Respite</h3>
        <p>Take time to recharge while your loved one participates in engaging, supervised, non-medical activities.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon">🧭</div>
        <h3>Resources</h3>
        <p>Access trusted information, community services, and caregiver support tailored to your family's needs.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon">🌐</div>
        <h3>Community Partnerships</h3>
        <p>Connecting caregivers to dementia-friendly businesses, organizations, and experiences throughout the community.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-32"><a href="programs.html" class="btn btn-outline">Explore Our Programs</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band-teal">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">Caregiver Sanctuary Network</span>
    <h2 style="margin-bottom: 14px;">Building communities where caregivers don't have to navigate dementia alone.</h2>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 28px;">The Caregiver Sanctuary Network is Legacy's innovative approach to caregiver support. By partnering with local businesses, organizations, and community spaces, we're creating welcoming environments where caregivers can access support, build relationships, prioritize their well-being, and find trusted resources throughout their community.</p>
    <a href="programs.html" class="btn btn-coral">Learn About the Caregiver Sanctuary Network</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="stats-band">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head text-center" style="margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">
      <span class="eyebrow">Our impact</span>
      <h2>Together, we're making a difference.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="stats-grid">
      <div class="stat"><div class="num">70+</div><div class="label">Family Caregivers Supported</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="num">1,000+</div><div class="label">Hours of Respite Provided</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="num">100,000+</div><div class="label">Community Members Reached Through Outreach</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="num">30</div><div class="label">Individuals Living with Dementia</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Caregiver voices</span>
      <h2>Stories from our community</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="quote-grid">
      <div class="quote-card">
        <blockquote>"Legacy reminded me that I mattered too."</blockquote>
      </div>
      <div class="quote-card">
        <blockquote>"Before Legacy, I felt completely alone. Now I have a community that understands what I'm going through."</blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-32"><a href="programs.html" class="btn btn-outline">Read More Stories</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="background: var(--sand);">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Upcoming events</span>
      <h2>Join us in the community.</h2>
      <p>Whether it's a caregiver meetup, respite program, educational workshop, or wellness event, there's always an opportunity to connect.</p>
    </div>
{%- for ev in events if ev.teaser %}
    <div class="card event-card{% if not loop.last %} mb-16{% endif %}">
      <div class="event-date"><div class="month">{{ ev.month | e }}</div><div class="day">{{ ev.day | e }}</div></div>
      <div>
        <span class="badge {{ ev.badge_class }}">{{ ev.badge | e }}</span>
        <h3 style="font-size: 18px; margin: 8px 0 4px;">{{ ev.title | e }}</h3>
        <div class="event-meta">{{ ev.meta | e }}</div>
        <a class="more" href="events.html">Register →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
{%- endfor %}
    <p class="mt-24"><a href="events.html" class="btn btn-outline">View Events</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Our Partners</span>
      <h2>Building stronger communities together.</h2>
      <p>We're proud to work alongside healthcare organizations, businesses, foundations, and community partners who share our commitment to improving the lives of dementia caregivers and their families.</p>
    </div>
    <p class="muted" style="max-width: 560px;"><em>Partner logos will be featured here as partnerships are confirmed.</em></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band-teal">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">Stay Connected</span>
    <h2 style="margin-bottom: 12px;">Don't miss upcoming events, caregiver resources, and community updates.</h2>
    <p style="margin-bottom: 28px;">Join our email list to receive the latest news, upcoming programs, caregiver resources, and opportunities to connect with our community.</p>
    <a href="#" class="btn btn-coral" onclick="openMembership(); return false;">Stay Connected</a>
  </div>
</section>

{% include '_membership-modal.html.j2' %}
<section id="donate" style="background: var(--sand);">
  <div class="container text-center">
    <span class="eyebrow">Donate</span>
    <h2 style="margin-bottom: 14px;">Every caregiver deserves support.</h2>
    <p class="muted" style="max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto 28px;">Your generosity helps provide respite, wellness opportunities, education, and meaningful community experiences for dementia caregivers and their loved ones. Together, we're creating communities where no caregiver has to navigate dementia alone.</p>
    <a href="#" class="btn btn-coral" onclick="alert('Demo: this connects to Legacy\'s existing GiveButter donation page.'); return false;">Make a Donation</a>
  </div>
</section>

{% include '_footer.html.j2' %}

<script src="app.js"></script>
<script src="nav-v2.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
